        "query_signature": "There are $K\\ge2$ experts with losses $\\ell_t:[K]\\to[0,1]$ fixed in advance. Choose $I_t$ before observing the complete current loss vector. Neighboring streams differ in one whole loss vector. The hindsight best expert loss $L_\\star=\\min_i\\sum_t\\ell_t(i)$ is unknown. Inputs $K,T,\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{priv}}$ are public. The infimum is over the mechanism class in Condition 4.1 of the source, not all private expert algorithms. Received feedback may be stored and reused computationally. No unrevealed historical information or extra queries to exhausted samples are available; any within-round full-function or common-sample access must be explicit.",
